<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 2.431 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 2.431 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to drain 2.431 billion pesos from the secondary market on Wednesday through five auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT	    TERM</p>
<p>    500 million    20 days</p>
<p>    500 million    19 days</p>
<p>    500 million    14 days</p>
<p>    500 million    13 days</p>
<p>    431 million     5 days</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
